# Job Applicant Analysis

When analyzing files under `data/`:

1. Read `config/job-criteria.yaml` for tech stack and weights.
2. Follow `.cursor/skills/analyze-job-candidates/SKILL.md` workflow.
3. **Filipino only** — exclude non-PH candidates with documented reason.
4. **Tier A:** ≤2 years junior dev. **Tier B:** fresh grad. **Auto-pass:** >2 years.
5. Bonus: Pampanga, honors, tech match, Git/GitHub, AI-built web apps.
6. Save rankings to `data/reports/` — never commit PII to git.
7. Summarize candidates; do not dump full resume text in chat.
